---
description: Delegation and subagent orchestration policy
alwaysApply: true
---

When delegating, use `docs/AGENT_WORKFLOW.md`, Delegation and independent
checking, and Failed checks and progress. Supply the outcome, exact edit
boundary, acceptance evidence and relevant constraints; host context inheritance
does not grant authority.

The parent owns integration, scope and acceptance. Delegate only bounded
non-sensitive implementation; integrated auth/security and schema remain with
the parent. Children never accept themselves. Use configured host models and
the capabilities in `.cursor/agents/`; debugger invocation is conditional and
explicit, and verification is read-only.
